> Master router for Copilot agents. Map every common task type to the **minimum** orientation maps + specialists needed. Read this file early in any non-trivial task.

---

## How to use

1. Restate the task in plain words.
2. Read `PROJECT.md` §3 (what is live on the App Store / TestFlight / backend) and skim `LEARNINGS.md` §D (agent corrections).
3. Skim "Task type → Read this" below.
4. Read ONLY the listed orientation maps (each ~50-150 lines).
5. Check matching `.github/instructions/*.instructions.md` (auto-loaded by `applyTo:`).
6. If medium/complex, hand to `@<PROJECT_SLUG>-orchestrator`.

